<Article
  title="How it broke"
  description="How a compile-time guard tested macro presence rather than value, allowing the software fallback to serve the affected seed-generation path."
  standfirst="A compile-time guard tested macro presence rather than value, allowing the software fallback to serve the affected seed-generation path from 2021 to 2026. This section reconstructs that path from the published code."
  depth="deep"
  kicker="How it broke"
